  "sourceTitle": "Thanks to you r/LocalLLaMA, my mom was able to use my app! The open-source app that can watch your screen and trigger actions. It is now easy to use, thanks to your feedback.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "a1e754518b96d6c3e224fc1d63813e5b1a7c9bb557e0f88d5e4b119c4b5961d1",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T23:58:55.769419Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T00:08:47.357158Z",
  "totalBlocks": 23,
  "translatedBlocks": 23,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74112e93aeb10b42",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版：我是一名独立开发者，想用一种简单、保护隐私的方式，让本地 LLM 观察我的屏幕，做一些简单的记录和通知。开发了一年后，我发布了 v3.0.0，我妈妈也第一次能用上它了，我想向大家说声谢谢！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f09a95b26db2ed8",
      "translationZh": "它旨在监控任何事物，以下是一些使用场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7145971d3923f07",
      "translationZh": "当我的模拟程序崩溃时，给我打电话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91b892e6457f0fcd",
      "translationZh": "当演唱会门票开售时，点击购买按钮。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f336774ff67c547f",
      "translationZh": "当我的 Steam 游戏下载完成时，通过 Telegram 给我发消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55c81abb42b8e282",
      "translationZh": "当渲染完成时，给我发一条短信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01da67bc787e3933",
      "translationZh": "当……[发生任何事情]，就……[通知我、记录下来]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b509a68312ae340e",
      "translationZh": "这是一个由 MCP 控制的微型智能体框架（我把这个智能体叫作 Observer）。所以，你在 Observer 中输入想要监控的内容，它就会控制这个框架来进行监控。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "643041e60a789b14",
      "translationZh": "桌面应用使用 llama.cpp 作为推理引擎，网页版使用 transformers.js，而且它们都支持你的 v1/chat/completions 端点 :DD",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "346453bf8aba13bc",
      "translationZh": "你可以直接在浏览器里试用，无需任何设置！……在浏览器里运行 gemma-4-e2b ONNX，太疯狂了！感谢 Xenova/HuggingFace 提供 transformers.js c:",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "075cfb01ce17122c",
      "translationZh": "它通过了老妈测试，哈哈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76399185d84edbe1",
      "translationZh": "你们告诉我，这个框架很酷，但设置智能体/工作流需要很多手动操作。所以过去一年，我一直在慢慢降低它的使用门槛，让任何技术背景的人都能使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b108af2e40c0ce0",
      "translationZh": "每隔几个月，我都会请我妈用一下这个应用。而这一次，她居然首次成功用本地 LLM 设置了一个监控智能体！这让我觉得，这个应用已经可以面向大众推广使用了（呜呼！）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "964b7ef0198cdf7b",
      "translationZh": "我希望这能让本地 LLM 对每个人都有用！教程/演示 这也正是这个项目的全部意义所在。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bd73dd27d3cc566f",
      "translationZh": "我的承诺与坚持 FOSS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "765507aa6a4f0acb",
      "translationZh": "Observer AI 的核心平台现在是、也永远都会是免费且开源的。这一点没有商量的余地。所有代码都在 GitHub 上，供你使用、创建分支副本和查看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ce57a8a5720d98",
      "translationZh": "我的底线是：“如果它对我免费，那它也应该对用户免费”，这一点永远不会改变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "caa413c08b71441a",
      "translationZh": "别再浪费时间了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66910eccb819606c",
      "translationZh": "如果没有从这个社区获得的启发，就不会有这个项目。我就是为你们打造它的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5471a74f0d0a970",
      "translationZh": "GitHub（所有代码都在这里！）：https://github.com/Roy3838/Observer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a5092494379120d",
      "translationZh": "应用链接：https://app.observer-ai.com/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ff95ee052bf1578",
      "translationZh": "我一直在往社交媒体上传内容！挑一个你喜欢的平台吧：YouTube | Tiktok | Instagram",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e13375326190c46d",
      "translationZh": "我今天一整天都会在这里，回答大家的所有问题。再次感谢你们所做的一切！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
